WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
BombermanDX: title screen.

00:07.000 --> 00:19.000
Story intro: Bomberman must cross the enchanted forest of Eldoria and defeat the monsters living in it.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
Stage 1, Ancient Forest. Ready? Go!

00:23.000 --> 00:45.000
Bombs clear the crates of the grid while enemies roam; the top bar shows score, lives, time and frame rate.

00:45.000 --> 01:05.000
The score climbs while the lives run out; the frame rate holds around 60 FPS.

01:05.000 --> 01:10.000
Out of lives: game over.

01:10.000 --> 01:20.700
Back to the title screen.
